  "schema": 1,
  "name": ".gear unequip moves equipped items to the bags or the mailbox",
  "contract": ".gear unequip [mail] [$player] is a Game Master command. Without mail it moves every equipped item into the bags and mails the items that do not fit, so a player with full bags gets all of them by mail and nothing is lost. With mail every equipped item is mailed and the bags are untouched. An ordinary player cannot run it.",
